      en: ["The hills are situated in the East Region of Cameroon.", "Precambrian granite and gneiss dominate the geology.", "The Kadey River is a major tributary of the Sangha.", "The area is a hub for the Cameroonian timber industry.", "There are two distinct rainy seasons occurring annually.", "The hills form a transition belt to the tropical rainforest."],
